    "finding": "The shared L2-to-DRAM miss core reproduces the measured L2-served fraction across all fifteen configurations with a mean absolute gap of 3.1 points and no systematic sign: the two largest deviations are +10.3 points at BK=128 and -11.2 points at the BM16/BN32/BK64/GSM1 production corner. The model also reproduces every trend, including the strong rise with GSM (73.6 to 93.8 percent measured, 67.9 to 95.6 predicted), the fall with BK and BN, and the near-invariance to BM. The core's replacement model is therefore not the source of the production grouped-MoE traffic residual.",
